#   - CRD clusterconfigauditreports.aquasecurity.github.io (included in the package as prerequisites/target-facts/no-crds-crds.yaml)
#   - CRD clusterinfraassessmentreports.aquasecurity.github.io (included in the package as prerequisites/target-facts/no-crds-crds.yaml)
