#   - CRD clustersbomreports.aquasecurity.github.io (included in the package as prerequisites/target-facts/no-crds-crds.yaml)
#   - CRD clustervulnerabilityreports.aquasecurity.github.io (included in the package as prerequisites/target-facts/no-crds-crds.yaml)
#   - CRD configauditreports.aquasecurity.github.io (included in the package as prerequisites/target-facts/no-crds-crds.yaml)
#   - CRD exposedsecretreports.aquasecurity.github.io (included in the package as prerequisites/target-facts/no-crds-crds.yaml)
#   - CRD infraassessmentreports.aquasecurity.github.io (included in the package as prerequisites/target-facts/no-crds-crds.yaml)
#   - CRD rbacassessmentreports.aquasecurity.github.io (included in the package as prerequisites/target-facts/no-crds-crds.yaml)
